        "like": 1
      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are very few worlds that exceed 1gb, most are under 200mb, and I would encourage creators who need more space to optimize instead. Bullet Time Agent is an entire 8+ hour video game within VRchat and it's under 600mb. Organism is under 450mb. Qoo H Bocuma Airport is just over 300mb. \n\nFrankly I'm concerned why you need more than 1.2gb.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
